# Cursor Rules for {{.ProjectName}}

## Clean Architecture Invariants
- Enforce strict 4-layer flow: Transport -> Application -> Domain <- Infrastructure.
- Domain layer must remain pure Go; no database or transport imports.
- Application layer depends on interfaces, never concrete infrastructure adapters.
- Handlers in Transport must not execute direct database queries.

## Comment Regions & Splicing Safety
- When editing managed files, only insert code between `// loy:region:<name>` and `// loy:endregion`.
- Never delete or corrupt comment region tags.

## Self-Healing Loop
- If architectural violations occur, run `loy check --format agent` to receive structured correction prompts.
